<P><STRONG>As promised, the readers of <A href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com">DrownedMadonna</A> can enter the party at a low price (10€ instead of 15€). But most&nbsp;of all, the first will have the free entry.&nbsp;So... hurry up!</STRONG></P>
