<P>She was a pop music legend whose dominance of the charts - she had five hits in the Top 20 all at the same time - has never been equalled. <STRONG>Only the great Madonna has come close to emulating that remarkable achievement. Like Madonna</STRONG>, Ruby Murray's contribution to pop music helped shape and define that industry. Other singing legends paid tribute to her. Sinatra himself, was a fan.</P>
